"""Canonical, immutable vNext research-state records.

The artifact registry and event ledger remain the only persistence and
provenance authorities.  This module supplies a strict typed envelope for
scientific state, deterministic JSON materialization, and validation of the
relationships between materialized revisions.  Markdown is deliberately only
a derived view.
"""

